  "bio": "Robert Moroski is a Hackettstown-based tattoo artist whose proficiency in black & gray and illustrative styles has garnered a loyal client base. His professionalism is embodied in the meticulous care he takes with each design, ensuring every piece is a testament to his philosophy that \"the life of the dead is placed in the memory of the living.\" Moroski's studio is known for its unwavering commitment to cleanliness, providing a safe and hygienic environment for all his artistry.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Hackettstown, New Jersey, United States\n\n\"Viva enim mortuorum in memoria vivorum est posita\"",
